	(text "SSD1306 module, pins GND VCC SCL SDA. Its own pull-ups\nhold SDA/SCL; Q1 cuts its supply when the meter is off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 96.52 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "99545394-b472-5513-9fa9-c35cd5d8a79b")
	)
	(text "Rev 3. Not for mains: inputs are rated 30 V DC max.\nThe 3.0 V rail stays on (1 uA LDO, MCU in Stop);\nSW5 disconnects the battery for storage."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 167.64 160.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bc1a5857-9991-5e1d-923a-c52052c1cf6d")
	)
	(text "Low range (0-100k, continuity, diode): drive OHM_LO high,\n  RX = R17 x ADC_OHM / (ADC_ELO - ADC_OHM).\nHigh range (100k-10M): drive OHM_HI high,\n  RX = R20 x ADC_OHM / (VDD - ADC_OHM).\nThe unused drive pin stays analog (high-Z). Firmware first pulls\nOHM_LO low: a passive load then reads ~0 V, a source does not.\nD2/D3 clamp E_LO/E_HI to GND and the battery: 30 V on the input\npushes 2.5 mA into the cell; the <1 mA through the pin clamps\ngoes to U4, which holds the 3.0 V rail at 3.3 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 274.32 182.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bda73e08-6551-562f-af24-7ca9b5c3fb5b")
	)
	(text "SW5 disconnects the battery; charging still works."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 48.26 115.57 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c9c23de0-8641-5e0f-b707-babbcaad7a03")
	)
